<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>packaging</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/packaging.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Custom Packaging Solutions</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                At Wuzwear Industry, we understand that presentation plays a huge role in how customers perceive your
                brand. Modern packaging trends are shifting towards eco-friendly solutions, and we recognize the
                importance of sustainability. That’s why we provide a wide range of packaging options, from standard
                polybags to biodegradable and premium alternatives. Whether you are a startup or an established clothing
                brand, our packaging options are designed to help your products stand out and reflect the value of your
                brand.


            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                We offer polybags in multiple weights, as well as twill bags, cloth bags, biodegradable bags, and paper
                bags. Each option can be customized with your own printed designs and logos, giving your packaging a
                unique, branded finish.




            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/packaging1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Custom Polybag Packing</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        As a standard service, we offer simple polybag packing at no additional cost. You can request
                        items to be packed individually, in dozens, or in any quantity you prefer. For brands that want
                        a premium touch, we also provide higher-quality or translucent polybags, with the option to add
                        your custom logo or artwork. Over the years, our packaging solutions have helped brands enhance
                        their presentation and boost sales.




                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/packaging2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Custom Tote Bag</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        For a more stylish packaging solution, we offer customizable tote bags. These bags can be
                        tailored in any size, shape, or style to fit your garments perfectly. Tote bags are reusable and
                        eco-friendly, making them an attractive choice for brands that want to offer practicality and
                        sustainability along with great design.




                    </p>


                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dye-services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="dye-row">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/packaging3.webp" alt="Colorful sublimated and dyed athletic t-shirts">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Custom Fabric Bags</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Fabric bags add a premium look and feel to your clothing line. They allow your customers to
                        experience the fabric quality even before opening the product and help create a memorable
                        unboxing experience. These bags are especially popular among brands aiming to present themselves
                        as high-end and fashion-forward.




                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dye-row row-reverse">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/packaging4.webp"
                        alt="A collection of vibrant fabric color swatches arranged together">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Custom Polymailers
                    </h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        If you want to take your shipping presentation to the next level, custom polymailers are a great
                        option. Unlike standard courier mailers, our polymailers can be printed with your brand’s logo
                        or designs. This ensures your garments are shipped securely while promoting your brand identity
                        at the same time.




                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


<%- include('partials/popup') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>